"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-08-PII-Pattern-HIPAA-Verification-Report.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-08-PII-Pattern-HIPAA-Verification-Report.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 963, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:05\", \"token_count\": 468, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-57\\n\\n# Slack Thread: High-DPI Scaling Math\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-08-19\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-19 13:51] Charlie**: Okay, I've updated the scaling math to use the `pdf-renderer`'s internal viewport dimensions instead of raw screen pixels, and cross-checked it against the preview-overlay coordinates from the redaction preview work — that's where the scale-factor error was showing up most.\\n\\n**[2026-08-19 14:26] Diana**: I'm still seeing a 1-2 pixel drift on some documents. It's better, but not perfect.\\n\\n**[2026-08-19 14:31] Charlie**: Are those documents rotated? I might need to check the rotation matrix too.\\n\\n**[2026-08-19 14:34] Diana**: Yeah, the one that's drifting is a landscape scan.\\n\\n**[2026-08-19 14:39] Charlie**: Got it. The coordinate transform for rotated pages in PDF is notorious. I'll add a check for the `/Rotate` key in the page dictionary.\\n\\n**[2026-08-19 14:41] Bob**: @Charlie do we need to worry about different DPIs between monitors in a multi-head setup?\\n\\n**[2026-08-19 14:44] Charlie**: Hopefully not if we stay in PDF point-space. I'll verify that tomorrow.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 57 slack thread high dpi scale math channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 19 2026 08 19 13 51 charli okay i ve updat the scale math to use the pdf render s intern viewport dimens instead of raw screen pixel and cross check it against the preview overlay coordin from the redact preview work that s where the scale factor error wa show up most 2026 08 19 14 26 diana i m still see a1 2 pixel drift on some document it s better but not perfect 2026 08 19 14 31 charli are those document rotat i might need to check the rotat matrix too 2026 08 19 14 34 diana yeah the one that s drift is a landscap scan 2026 08 19 14 39 charli got it the coordin transform for rotat page in pdf is notori i ll add a check for the rotat key in the page dictionari 2026 08 19 14 41 bob charli do we need to worri about differ dpis between monitor in a multi head setup 2026 08 19 14 44 charli hope not if we stay in pdf point space i ll verifi that tomorrow\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e90874188a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-19-high-dpi-scaling-math.md\", \"id\": \"60108b38a02a0431\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2471287065071753, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.08500909501025047, \"vector_similarity\": 0.6254078, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-19-high-dpi-scaling-math.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e90874188a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-19-high-dpi-scaling-math.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-19-high-dpi-scaling-math.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1125, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:04:00\", \"token_count\": 338, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \" - *Opened the task because the strict offline air-gapped mode must be testable.*\\n\\n- **2026-08-10**: Diana - Offline Sign-off (Completed)\\n\\n - *Signed off on the offline batch run, depending on the completed AES-256 encryption pipeline, noting a 45-second remote licence-check hang; sign-off recorded as preliminary only, not a compliance certification.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"open the task becaus the strict offlin air gap mode must be testabl 2026 08 10 diana offlin sign off complet sign off on the offlin batch run depend on the complet ae 256 encrypt pipelin note a 45 second remot licenc check hang sign off record a preliminari onli not a complianc certif\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e969dcb28a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"id\": \"b6b76363ffc0abba\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2449400608297191, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.047140259756741555, \"vector_similarity\": 0.70647293, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e969dcb28a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1365, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:41\", \"token_count\": 610, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-29\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-29\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-29\\n\\n**Title**: Offline auth with key rotation for air-gapped installs\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-01\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nProvide offline-mode authentication for air-gapped deployments, including a key-rotation flow that doesn't assume an always-on network. Testing against a local auth mock showed that key rotation cannot complete without network access in an air-gapped setting, and the task remains blocked with no resolution yet.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-29\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-29\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-29\\n\\n**Title**: Offline auth with key rotation for air-gapped installs\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-01\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Authentication works fully offline for air-gapped deployment scenarios.\\n\\n- Key-rotation flow completes without requiring network access.\\n\\n- Blocking issue (rotation dependent on network) is resolved before the task can close.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-29\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-29\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-29\\n\\n**Title**: Offline auth with key rotation for air-gapped installs\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-01\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nProvide offline-mode authentication for air-gapped deployments, including a key-rotation flow that doesn't assume an always-on network. Testing against a local auth mock showed that key rotation cannot complete without network access in an air-gapped setting, and the task remains blocked with no resolution yet.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-29\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-29\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-29\\n\\n**Title**: Offline auth with key rotation for air-gapped installs\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-01\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-08-01**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\\n - *Opened the task because air-gapped deployments require offline-mode authentication.*\\n\\n- **2026-08-05**: Alice - Key Rotation Block (Blocked)\\n\\n - *Testing against a local auth mock showed key rotation cannot complete offline in an air-gapped setting, with no resolution found yet.*\\n\", \"content_lt